      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# FACE SWAP (ReActor) + ESRGAN Upscale\n\n## Which image is which\n- **LoadImage (TARGET)** - the image that RECEIVES the face: your generated scene.\n- **LoadImage (REFERENCE FACE)** - whose face to use: her portrait (reference_gray.png works).\n- ReActorFaceSwap: input_image = TARGET, source_image = REFERENCE FACE.\n\n## Blurry face? -> face_restore\n- inswapper's swapped face is soft BY NATURE - ESRGAN sharpens everything AROUND it, making the face look blurrier by contrast.\n- face_restore_model = GFPGANv1.4.pth FIXES this: it restores the swapped face's detail. Enabled by default now.\n- face_restore_visibility = 1 (full). Lower toward 0.5 for a subtler restore.\n- Alternatives: codeformer (higher fidelity, can over-smooth), GPEN-BFR-2048.onnx (best for large faces, ONNX).\n\n## How the swap works\n- InsightFace AUTO-DETECTS the face in BOTH images - no cropping needed. Normal photos with backgrounds are fine.\n- Multiple faces in the target: input_faces_index picks which ('0' = first, '0,1' = two, etc.). source_faces_index does the same for the reference.\n- detect_gender_input/source = 'no' (swaps regardless of detected gender).\n\n## Upscale toggle (IAMCCS_LazyAnySwitch)\n- Flux: OFF / Qwen: ON (default OFF).\n- ON = 4x-UltraSharp ESRGAN upscale of the whole swapped image. Model-free image pass (no diffusion), so it is fast and cannot drift anything.\n- OFF = the restored swap goes straight to SaveImage at original size.\n\n## Better identity? ReActorBuildFaceModel\n- If one reference image is not enough for a stable identity, ReActorBuildFaceModel combines MULTIPLE images of her into one face model, fed to ReActorFaceSwap via the face_model input (instead of source_image).\n\n## Notes\n- Built on the UNCENSORED fork (hirad/comfyui-reactor-node) - the main Gourieff repo has a nudity detector that blocks 18+ content.\n- Works on ANY image (Krea 2 outputs, photos, anything) - the swap operates on the finished image, not the diffusion path.\n- The swap itself needs NO diffusion models - only inswapper_128.onnx (swap), GFPGANv1.4.pth (restore) and 4x-UltraSharp.pth (upscale)."
      ]
    }
